@startuml Sequence_Replay
title BSS — Последовательность работы Replay
autonumber
actor "Оператор" as Operator
participant "Replay CLI" as CLI
participant "Replay Service" as Replay
participant "Dataset Reader" as Reader
participant "Replay Clock" as Clock
participant "Analysis Engine" as Analysis
participant "Event Stream" as Events
participant "State / Audit" as State
Operator -> CLI : Запуск replay(dataset_id, version)
CLI -> Replay : start(run configuration)
Replay -> Replay : Создать run_id
Replay -> Reader : Открыть immutable Dataset
Replay -> Clock : Инициализировать replay time
loop По каждой свече
    Reader -> Replay : Следующая candle
    Replay -> Clock : Установить event_time
    Replay -> Analysis : CANDLE_CLOSED
    Analysis -> Events : Опубликовать immutable event
    Events -> State : Обновить state / audit
end
Replay -> Replay : Завершить run
Replay --> CLI : Replay completed
CLI --> Operator : Результат replay
@enduml
